id: gateway-ops
name: Gateway Ops
triggers: gateway, cron, schedule, job, queue, running, stuck, approval, restart
description: Guides gateway, cron, queue, job, and approval inspection.

Use gateway for overview, recent events, runs, approvals, and provider status.
Use cron for schedules and background jobs.
Use session_status for per-session status.
Use run_terminal_command only for explicit local commands or verified maintenance actions.

If replies are stuck, first inspect gateway queue and provider readiness before restarting.
